WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.670
Lamp for admins. Part five: AI activity.

2
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:10.400
Claude does three jobs in Lamp. This page shows each one, and what it cost.

3
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.920
AI activity is a tab only admins see.

4
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:24.550
Claude reads bank statements, writes the Today list, and writes follow-up drafts. Lamp's own code does the math, and decides which funders fit.

5
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:31.960
Claude runs on an Anthropic key. Until Lamp has one, Claude is off, and Lamp works on its own rules.

6
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:39.590
Make a key in the Anthropic console, under API keys. Anthropic bills whoever owns the key.

7
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:47.830
Paste it here, and press Test and save. Lamp checks the key with Anthropic first. A wrong key is refused, and nothing is saved.

8
00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:56.360
Once it's saved, the card shows who saved it, and when. The key itself is never shown again.

9
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.030
Replace the key swaps in a new one. Remove the key turns Claude off.

10
00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:08.370
Each job has a monthly limit. Fifty dollars for the statement reader, and fifty for the Today list and drafts.

11
00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:15.620
When a limit runs out, Claude stops until the first of the month. Lamp keeps working on its own rules.

12
00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:21.150
Under the limits are this month's counts for each job, and how many failed.

13
00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:28.560
Then a line for each time Claude was used. When, what it did, who it was for, and the cost.

14
00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:31.200
Click the business name to open that file.

15
00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Failed shows the reason beside it.

16
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:40.030
Paste the key on this page only. Never in a text, an email or a chat.

17
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.920
Add the key. Watch the spend. Check what failed.
